{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Burning Boundaries is a story-driven visual novel where love, loyalty, and temptation collide. Play as a renowned photographer whose life brings as much passion as it does challenges. Drawn into Lara\u2019s orbit, balancing ambition with complicated bonds, while your choices shape the story  and how far you\u2019re willing to go as lines begin to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong><u>Meet the\u00a0Main Characters</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lara</strong><br>Ambitious and charismatic, Lara is chasing her dream of becoming a TV anchor. Balancing her career goals with her role as a mother \u2014 and her hidden temptations \u2014 will shape your relationship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006400/extras/46b0b299000ee762d8f0923dfc6bd334.poster.avif?t=1761303720\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006400/extras/46b0b299000ee762d8f0923dfc6bd334.webm?t=1761303720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Angelica</strong><br>A spoiled and sassy manipulator who thrives on defying authority, quick to test boundaries. She\u2019s both an obstacle and a source of unexpected choices in your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006400/extras/12611284c3acde3e8f2bb9e7a2977243.poster.avif?t=1761303720\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006400/extras/12611284c3acde3e8f2bb9e7a2977243.webm?t=1761303720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Erica</strong><br>Well-mannered and kind-hearted, yet sometimes too naive, she joins the household as a babysitter. Reserved and rule-abiding on the outside, her suppressed attraction to strong, dominant men occasionally rises to the surface.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006400/extras/e5ddfe7253c9a4ab438386db76f4cd8c.poster.avif?t=1761303720\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006400/extras/e5ddfe7253c9a4ab438386db76f4cd8c.webm?t=1761303720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd39 <u>Feature Highlights</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse adult themes</strong> \u2013 Explore a wide range of relationship dynamics and optional kinks, including\u00a0<strong>harem, threesomes, swingers, hotwife/cuckold/cuckquean, corruption, cheating</strong>\u00a0and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching storylines</strong> \u2013 Shape your experience through meaningful choices. Follow optional kink-focused routes, each carrying persistent consequences and leading to unique endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic presentation</strong> \u2013 Enjoy thousands of hand-crafted 3D renders and hundreds of detailed animations that bring every scene to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extended playtime</strong> \u2013 One playthrough includes 6-8 hours of content, with over <strong>20+ hours of total gameplay</strong> if you explore every route.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable extras</strong> \u2013 Access special galleries to revisit your favorite moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive audio</strong> \u2013 An original soundtrack and atmospheric sound effects enhance both dramatic and intimate scenes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006400/extras/ad46a0e09c502ca383b10a8013e1dde7.poster.avif?t=1761303720\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006400/extras/ad46a0e09c502ca383b10a8013e1dde7.webm?t=1761303720\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd39 <u>What NOT to Expect</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A story-driven experience</strong> \u2013 This isn\u2019t a sandbox or open-world; it\u2019s a tightly scripted visual novel with clear direction and narrative depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Curated characters</strong> \u2013 The cast is designed with purpose; body types and looks are not customizable, ensuring every scene feels intentional.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Beyond romance</strong> \u2013 This is not a simple love story. Expect layered power dynamics, fetishes, and adult themes that push boundaries.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4006400?t=1761303720","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4006400?t=1761303720","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006400/7ab9ea09b7fb16321d768c34bc5889b4655fcdd8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761303720","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006400/7ab9ea09b7fb16321d768c34bc5889b4655fcdd8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761303720","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id"